      "description": "The text 'jews and americans' is overlaid on the image of a person wearing a kippah in front of the American flag. The visual material (the person) is mapped onto the textual entity 'jews and americans' to imply that this individual embodies or represents both Jewish identity and American nationality, reinforcing the hateful stereotype that these two groups are collectively responsible for global problems. This mapping is central to the meme's antisemitic conspiracy narrative.",
